{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/e635d6ad621d8016eb937e84b3dca978.poster.avif?t=1765891926\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/e635d6ad621d8016eb937e84b3dca978.webm?t=1765891926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/e635d6ad621d8016eb937e84b3dca978.mp4?t=1765891926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the apocalypse - it\u2019s not all bad</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the collapse of hypercapitalism, corporate AI empires, and failed efforts to fix climate change, a few scrappy survivors (and a lot of eccentric robots) are trying to rebuild the world, one potato at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hello World</strong> is a cozy-chaotic <strong>survival colony builder</strong> about two sides of life after the end: one where you <strong>build, farm, and craft</strong>, and another where you <strong>explore, fight, and reprogram</strong> the rogue machines left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At home, you grow food, craft shelters, decorate your base, and turn survival into something beautiful. Out in the wilds, you scavenge, strategize, and face down robots gone haywire - some of which you can <strong>hack, befriend, and customize</strong>\u00a0in your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a home, paint your walls, or charge into tactical chaos - it\u2019s your choice. Deep systems, dark humor, and delightful mayhem, designed to fit into your life instead of taking it over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/f0655868516de967b2a34a418be92ca4.poster.avif?t=1765891926\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/f0655868516de967b2a34a418be92ca4.webm?t=1765891926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/f0655868516de967b2a34a418be92ca4.mp4?t=1765891926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, farm, and craft - your way</strong><br>Design your settlement, grow crops, and create everything you need to thrive in the ruins of the old world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, fight, and reclaim</strong><br>Venture into the wilderness to discover resources, uncover secrets, and take on rogue robots in tactical encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reprogram and customize robots</strong><br>Turn hostile machines into allies, tweak their programming, and outfit them with new parts and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy chaos with friends</strong><br>Team up in online co-op and share in the laughter, disasters, and victories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veteran-crafted gameplay</strong><br>Built by developers from DICE, Bioware, CDPR, Guerrilla, Remedy, and more - deep, funny, and endlessly replayable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approachable depth</strong><br>Survival and strategy that respect your time - drop in for a quick session or lose a weekend rebuilding civilization.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/fa98e211112df0ee984ccdb420148b0a.poster.avif?t=1765891926\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/fa98e211112df0ee984ccdb420148b0a.webm?t=1765891926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/fa98e211112df0ee984ccdb420148b0a.mp4?t=1765891926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world built by survivors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agency is an independent studio founded in 2025 by gaming veterans from DICE, Bioware, CDPR, Guerrilla, Remedy, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re building the kind of games we want to play - alive, funny, and deeply human.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048100?t=1765891926","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/e2d00f72fa3d9e3a10372d98fb76904edb48acbc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765891926","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/018a59ba11e480186d585b4391a683685d725efa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765891926","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/018a59ba11e480186d585b4391a683685d725efa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765891926","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/e635d6ad621d8016eb937e84b3dca978.poster.avif?t=1765891926\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"http